WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,290
Ouch, ouch, my aunt's arm doesn't hurt. It can't be cold.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:05,210
It would be nice if I could eat some dried strawberries

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,200
Six dishes Liuliu Dashun

4
